  "description": "Managed .NET binding for the KeyNub USB-C license dongle: verify authenticity, open an encrypted session, read/write license records, monotonic counters, and app-data envelope encryption. Driverless on Windows, Linux, and macOS. Wraps the native keynub_licdongle core (no protocol or crypto logic in managed code).",
